        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 10 Errigal House is an exceptional one-bedroom, first-floor apartment, superbly positioned within this quiet and exclusive residential development in the heart of Donnybrook. The property is set within a secluded, beautifully landscaped setting that offers a rare sense of privacy and tranquillity, while remaining just moments from the exceptional amenities of Dublin 4.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 54 sq. m. the well-proportioned accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generously sized double bedroom, a bright open-plan living and dining area, a stylish, fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, and a spacious main bathroom.\r\nBoth the apartment and the building have recently undergone an extensive programme of refurbishment and modernisation, bringing the accommodation up to an excellent contemporary standard throughout. These comprehensive upgrades were thoughtfully designed to enhance comfort, efficiency and aesthetic appeal, resulting in bright, elegant interiors, improved energy performance and high-quality finishes. The result is a truly turnkey home, ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nCombining modern design, quality upgrades and a peaceful, mature setting, Errigal House presents a rare opportunity to enjoy refined, low maintenance living in a well-managed development in one of Dublin’s most sought-after residential locations. \r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION \r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: L-Shaped hallway with storage closet. Leading to;\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Room: (7.07m x 3.40m) Wooden flooring with an abundance of natural light. The kitchen is fully fitted with an extensive range of wall and floor units, quartz countertops, Whirlpool fridge/freezer, Bosch washing machine and dryer, and Bosch dishwasher.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (4.41m x 3.58m) Carpet flooring, built in wardrobes, radiator and electrical points. \r\n\r\nBathroom: (2.60m x 1.69m) Tiled wall and flooring, wc, whb and walk in shower\r\n\r\nLocation Overview – Eglinton Road, Donnybrook, Dublin 4\r\nEglinton Road enjoys an exceptional position in the heart of Donnybrook, one of Dublin 4’s most desirable residential addresses. This elegant, tree-lined setting combines calm suburban charm with immediate access to the vibrancy of Dublin’s city lifestyle, making it an ideal location for , families and downsizers alike.\r\n\r\nExceptional Connectivity\r\nThe area is superbly served by public and private transport links. A number of frequent Dublin Bus routes provide swift and direct access to the city centre, St. Stephen’s Green, UCD, Ballsbridge and beyond. The DART at Sandymount and Sydney Parade is easily accessible, while the nearby Luas Green Line at Beechwood offers fast and efficient travel across the city. With ease of access to the N11 and M50, commuting to business districts, Dublin Airport and regional routes is seamless.\r\n\r\nDining & Social Lifestyle\r\nDonnybrook is renowned for its vibrant café culture and excellent dining scene. A carefully curated selection of restaurants, bistros and casual eateries are within walking distance, including local favourites and artisan cafés. The surrounding districts of Ranelagh, Ballsbridge and Sandymount further enhance the culinary offering, featuring award-winning restaurants, stylish wine bars and relaxed gastropubs, catering to every taste and occasion.\r\n\r\nAmenities & Lifestyle\r\nResidents benefit from an abundance of premium amenities on their doorstep. Herbert Park – one of Dublin’s most beautiful and expansive green spaces – is just a short stroll away, offering tranquil walking routes, sports facilities, playgrounds and weekend markets. Donnybrook Stadium, boutique gyms, yoga studios and leisure clubs provide excellent recreational options.\r\nEveryday conveniences are equally well catered for, with high-quality supermarkets, speciality food stores, independent boutiques and essential services all easily accessible. The area is also home to some of Dublin’s most prestigious schools and is within close proximity of Trinity College Dublin and University College Dublin.\r\n\r\nA Prime Dublin 4 Address\r\nEglinton Road represents a rare opportunity to enjoy refined residential living in a prestigious and highly sought-after location, combining peaceful surroundings with unrivalled access to the best of Dublin’s lifestyle, culture and connectivity."
      },
